# Workflow and agent worktrees are never repository content
.claude/worktrees/

# scroll-craft build output. The skill resolves its workspace from
# SCROLLCRAFT_HOME, then the nearest .scrollcraft.json, then
# <project root>/scrollcraft, so ignoring the default location alone leaves the
# other two paths exposed. Upstream reports a single build with ten video legs
# at 300MB+ and a working lab directory at 12GB, and committing one puts it in
# history permanently, so the video extensions are ignored by content as well as
# by location. The repository tracks no .mp4, .mov or .webm today.
scrollcraft/
.scrollcraft.json
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
